      {
        "y": 408.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I won’t have dessert, thanks. You’re lucky being so slim, but I’m afraid I have to count the calories /"
      },
      {
        "y": 420.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 433.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I have to be a bit calorie-conscious these days. [be careful how many calories I eat]"
      },
